{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000029245","bookName":"El traicionado sin lobo es el rey licántropo","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000029245/42000029245.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":4425979,"followCount":143775,"introduction":"Aarón Silva entregó su lobo Alfa a Serena Castro para cumplir el sueño de ella. Pero al volverse poderosa, ella rompió su lazo y lo abandonó como a un inútil sin lobo. Bendecido en secreto por la Diosa Lunar, Aarón despierta el poder ancestral del Rey Licántropo. Años después, la ambiciosa Serena invade manadas buscando el dominio total. Ocultando su verdadera identidad, Aarón deberá enfrentar a su examor, proteger a sus aliados y ajustar cuentas.","chapterCount":45,"labels":["The Chosen One","Supernatural"],"tags":["The Chosen One","Supernatural"],"typeTwoIds":[321,308,309],"typeTwoNames":["Traición","Identidad Secreta","Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":321,"name":"Traición","replaceName":"traición"},{"id":308,"name":"Identidad Secreta","replaceName":"identidad-secreta"},{"id":309,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Traición","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-traicionado-sin-lobo-es-el-rey-licántropo","bookNameLower":"el-traicionado-sin-lobo-es-el-rey-licántropo","shelfTime":"2026-10-05 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-10-05 10:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701693692","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/29/5x4/54x2/542x9/54292000024/701693692_1/701693692.720p.wz.h264.mp4?Expires=1795204800&Signature=yBMnw1SUMZMrR0DtvyoMSuc6PQGq1-cF0Sm1GcHsb960B4LsTx~ueQfInVUcBj2y-TmPtpfMrMb5~bNG-GgvZdlmO5GSTptlrxMwqXSBtq~9Z9WkUfj0iDJ-gVriSv-uQKVTHPdHlz4VkzHQTxRB8NJXK2g8icsm1YfFb36MiNqvvVXStCZfXR7iOMQbZ3icvkh1r5Yr9LUU8V2b4AJzBhbPYzjtb1qJlrL~OYnRgzR1jqJ4krlHJkpFjxmM5FkQg3CPr3wlpPPcIDid06toTTJBg8M-wuhJ1hEEYwKAjCBMBkw~jEsWLo9IJ6704bbnBHM5jLdAUF2KYVKCbK8tnw__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.d